invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/pinned-checkers.sh
reason: lint-wide-multiply stops checking that its clang is the pinned
  version. Its catch script runs it alone, without lint-toolchain, so
  another clang's code generation would decide the counts it holds to
  their recorded ceilings. test/pinned-checkers.sh hands it an older and a
  newer stand-in clang and requires it to stop on the pin.

--- old
	$(call REQUIRE_PINNED,lint-wide-multiply,$(CLANG_RV),version $(LLVM_MAJOR)\.,LLVM $(LLVM_MAJOR))
--- new
